{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Seven[Gm7]ty souls went [Cm7]down to the [F7]Nile
[Bb]Gad's sons [Gm7]walked in a [Cm7]single [F7]file
[Bb]Ziphion, Hag[Gm7]gi, and [Cm7]Shuni [F7]too
[Bb]Ezbon, Eri, Arodi, Areli's [F7]view
[Bb]Jacob's [Gm7]household, [Cm7]six-ty-six [F7]count
[Bb]Two sons [Gm7]born [Cm7]in the new [F7]ground
[Bb]Seventy [Gm7]total, [Cm7]safe [F7]and sound
In the [Bb]land where the wheat is found
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Wil[Eb]derness years, the census calls
[Bb]Clans of Gad, standing in the halls
[Eb]From Zephon to the Zephonite [F]name
Shuni's line, none lost from [Bb]fame
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Shu[Gm7]nite clan, [Cm7]east of [F7]the Jordan [Bb]stream
Live[Gm7]stock heavy, [Cm7]the qui[F7]et dream
Your [Bb]inheri[Gm7]tance lies on [Cm7]the oth[F7]er side
With [Bb]the Reu[Gm7]benites, proudly pride
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Bb] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Moses [Gm7]spoke of the [Cm7]fathers' [F7]sin
[Bb]Kadesh [Gm7]Barnea, the wan[Cm7]dering [F7]spin
[Bb]Forty [Gm7]years in the [Cm7]desert [F7]heat
But your [Bb]flocks are a powerful feat
Build [Gm7]pens for the sheep [Cm7]and the [F7]goat
[Bb]C[Gm7]ities [Cm7]for the chil[F7]dren, afloat
[Bb]We will [Gm7]arm our[Cm7]selves for [F7]the fight
[Bb]March ahead in the morning [Gm7]light
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Shu[Cm7]nite clan, [F7]east of the [Bb]Jordan [Gm7]stream
Livestock [Cm7]heavy, [F7]the quiet [Bb]dream
Your in[Gm7]heritance [Cm7]lies on [F7]the other [Bb]side
With [Gm7]the Reubenites, proud[Eb]ly pride
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Until the land is subdued be[Bb]fore
The enemies gone, the wars no more
[Eb]Then you may return, free of [F]debt
To the Lord and to Is[Bb]rael, set
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm7]Sihon's kin[Cm7]gdom, Og's [F7]Bas[Bb]han land
[Gm7]Moses [Cm7]gave it, [F7]in [Bb]his hand
[Gm7]Gad and [Cm7]Reuben, [F7]side by [Bb]side
With half [Gm7]of Manas[Bb]seh, they abide
The whole [Gm7]ter[Cm7]ritory, c[F7]ity [Bb]to city
[Gm7]A pos[Cm7]session, a [F7]ho[Bb]ly pity
[Gm7]No longer [Cm7]crossing, [F7]but staying [Bb]true
In the east, in the ancient [Gm7]view
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Shu[Cm7]nite clan, [F7]east of the [Bb]Jordan [Gm7]stream
Live[Cm7]stock hea[F7]vy, the qui[Bb]et dream
Your [Gm7]inheri[Cm7]tance lies [F7]on the oth[Bb]er side
[Gm7]With the Reube[Bb]nites, proud[Gm7]ly pride
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Shuni's [Cm7]name, in [F7]the book [Bb]it remains
A [Gm7]thread in [Cm7]the lin[F7]eage, [Bb]through the rains
East [Gm7]of the [Cm7]river, [F7]the land is yours
[Bb]In the promise, in the silent hours
{end_of_verse}

